   "html": "<div class=\"pic\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 298 48.5\" width=\"298\" height=\"48.5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;background:#fff;border-radius:10px\" letter-spacing=\"0\"><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"24\" x2=\"274\" y2=\"24\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"24\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/><circle cx=\"274\" cy=\"24\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#333\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"37\" dy=\".35em\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#333\">A</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"37\" dy=\".35em\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#333\">C</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"37\" dy=\".35em\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#333\">B</text><text x=\"74\" y=\"9\" dy=\".35em\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#4B44E6\">AC</text><text x=\"199\" y=\"9\" dy=\".35em\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#4B44E6\">CB</text></svg></div><p>Якщо точка C лежить на відрізку AB:</p><div class=\"rule-box\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;font-weight:800\">AB = AC + CB</div><p>Частина = ціле − інша частина: CB = AB − AC.</p>"
